 Why did Paul change from one project to another?</span><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">A</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-c8-t3-l-q23\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"A\"></span><span>His first job was not well organised.</span></div><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">B</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-c8-t3-l-q23\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"B\"></span><span>He found doing the routine work very boring.</span></div><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">C</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-c8-t3-l-q23\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"C\"></span><span>The work was too physically demanding.</span></div></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"><span><strong class=\"source-question-number\">24</strong> In the village community, he learnt how important it was to</span><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">A</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-c8-t3-l-q24\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"A\"></span><span>respect family life.</span></div><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">B</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-c8-t3-l-q24\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"B\"></span><span>develop trust.</span></div><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">C</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-c8-t3-l-q24\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"C\"></span><span>use money wisely.</span></div></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"><span><strong class=\"source-question-number\">25</strong> What does Paul say about his project manager?</span><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">A</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-c8-t3-l-q25\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"A\"></span><span>He let Paul do most of the work.</span></div><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">B</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-c8-t3-l-q25\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"B\"></span><span>His plans were too ambitious.</span></div><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">C</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-c8-t3-l-q25\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"C\"></span><span>He was very supportive of Paul.</span></div></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"><span><strong class=\"source-question-number\">26</strong> Paul was surprised to be given</span><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">A</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-c8-t3-l-q26\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"A\"></span><span>a computer to use.</span></div><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">B</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-c8-t3-l-q26\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"B\"></span><span>so little money to live on.</span></div><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">C</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-c8-t3-l-q26\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"C\"></span><span>an extension to his contract.</span></div></div></div>","sourceQuestionCount":6},{"id":"en-c8-t3-l-g3-1","type":"source_html","ieltsQuestionType":"matching_features","instructions":"","sourceHeading":"Questions 27-30","sourceHtml":"<div class=\"source-question-section-content\"><p>What does Paul decide about each of the following modules?</p><p>Write the correct letter, A, B or C, next to questions 27-30.</p></div><div class=\"source-questions\"><div class=\"matching-dnd-questions\"><div class=\"source-question-item\"> • Gender Studies in Latin America<span class=\"options-drop-zone dnd-zone\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">27</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-c8-t3-l-q27\" data-luma-kind=\"drop\"></span></span></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"> • Second Language Acquisition<span class=\"options-drop-zone dnd-zone\"><strong class=